1
00:00:00,311 --> 00:00:05,619
On 30 April 1945, Adolf Hitler
died in a bunker under Berlin.

2
00:00:07,151 --> 00:00:10,638
Within six weeks, Moscow was
saying he might still be alive.

3
00:00:12,232 --> 00:00:14,978
This is what the records show,
and what they leave open.

4
00:00:22,431 --> 00:00:25,979
By April 1945, Germany
had lost the war.

5
00:00:27,411 --> 00:00:31,289
On 16 April, the Red Army
attacked across the Oder river,

6
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:35,579
and within three days the last defence
line east of Berlin had collapsed.

7
00:00:37,191 --> 00:00:42,959
On 20 April, Hitler's fifty sixth birthday,
Soviet guns began shelling Berlin.

8
00:00:44,511 --> 00:00:46,378
Boys of the Hitler Youth and old men

9
00:00:46,398 --> 00:00:49,359
of the Volkssturm were
sent to hold the streets.

10
00:00:50,691 --> 00:00:54,459
By 25 April, Soviet armies
had encircled the city.

11
00:00:55,730 --> 00:00:59,420
Hitler had lived since 16
January in the Fuehrerbunker,

12
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:03,319
a concrete shelter beneath the
garden of the Reich Chancellery.

13
00:01:04,871 --> 00:01:08,939
With him were secretaries, doctors,
guards and his closest aides.

14
00:01:10,451 --> 00:01:12,525
Martin Bormann managed his affairs.

15
00:01:12,956 --> 00:01:15,391
Joseph Goebbels, the
propaganda minister,

16
00:01:15,622 --> 00:01:19,320
moved into the bunker with his
wife Magda and their six children.

17
00:01:20,671 --> 00:01:23,090
Eva Braun, his companion
for many years,

18
00:01:23,201 --> 00:01:25,319
had come to Berlin, and chose to stay.

19
00:01:26,811 --> 00:01:28,306
On 22 April,

20
00:01:28,437 --> 00:01:32,059
Hitler learned that an attack he had
ordered had not been carried out.

21
00:01:33,571 --> 00:01:36,891
He broke down, told his
generals that the war was lost,

22
00:01:37,082 --> 00:01:39,419
and said that he would stay
in Berlin and shoot himself.

23
00:01:40,811 --> 00:01:43,428
He asked an SS doctor
for the surest method,

24
00:01:43,980 --> 00:01:46,839
and was advised to combine
poison with a pistol shot.

25
00:01:51,431 --> 00:01:54,519
On 28 April, Hitler heard a radio report

26
00:01:54,539 --> 00:01:58,479
that Heinrich Himmler had offered
to surrender to the western Allies.

27
00:01:59,891 --> 00:02:00,863
He called it treason,

28
00:02:00,974 --> 00:02:03,883
and ordered that Himmler's
representative at his headquarters,

29
00:02:03,903 --> 00:02:06,199
Hermann Fegelein, be shot.

30
00:02:07,732 --> 00:02:10,398
Fegelein was married
to Eva Braun's sister.

31
00:02:12,172 --> 00:02:14,338
In the early hours of 29 April,

32
00:02:14,358 --> 00:02:18,059
in a small room in the bunker,
Hitler married Eva Braun.

33
00:02:19,691 --> 00:02:22,800
A city official named Walter
Wagner conducted the ceremony,

34
00:02:22,820 --> 00:02:25,898
and Goebbels and Bormann
signed as witnesses.

35
00:02:27,892 --> 00:02:30,268
Afterwards, Hitler
dictated his private will

36
00:02:30,299 --> 00:02:33,879
and political testament to
his secretary, Traudl Junge.

37
00:02:35,232 --> 00:02:37,459
He signed them at about
four in the morning.

38
00:02:38,751 --> 00:02:42,212
The testament named Admiral
Karl Doenitz as head of state,

39
00:02:42,584 --> 00:02:44,400
and Goebbels as chancellor.

40
00:02:45,711 --> 00:02:47,719
In it he wrote that he did not wish

41
00:02:47,739 --> 00:02:50,359
to fall into enemy hands
and be put on show.

42
00:02:51,851 --> 00:02:54,170
Three couriers carried
copies out of Berlin,

43
00:02:54,441 --> 00:02:56,439
to reach Doenitz and
other commanders.

44
00:02:57,891 --> 00:03:00,176
That afternoon, news
reached the bunker

45
00:03:00,196 --> 00:03:03,753
that Benito Mussolini had
been shot by Italian partisans,

46
00:03:03,964 --> 00:03:06,479
and that his body had
been put on public display.

47
00:03:08,071 --> 00:03:10,210
Hitler had been given
cyanide capsules,

48
00:03:10,522 --> 00:03:11,937
and he doubted that they would work.

49
00:03:13,651 --> 00:03:17,305
He ordered a doctor to test
one on his dog, Blondi.

50
00:03:17,325 --> 00:03:18,299
The dog died.

51
00:03:23,994 --> 00:03:23,974
At one in the morning,

52
00:03:23,994 --> 00:03:26,201
Field Marshal Keitel
reported that none

53
00:03:26,221 --> 00:03:28,959
of the armies Hitler was
counting on could reach Berlin.

54
00:03:30,491 --> 00:03:31,904
At about half past two,

55
00:03:32,015 --> 00:03:34,362
Hitler came into a
corridor and shook hands

56
00:03:34,382 --> 00:03:36,999
with some twenty people who
had gathered to say goodbye.

57
00:03:38,451 --> 00:03:40,247
On the morning of 30 April,

58
00:03:40,358 --> 00:03:43,147
Soviet troops were fighting
within about five hundred metres

59
00:03:43,167 --> 00:03:43,819
of the bunker.

60
00:03:45,211 --> 00:03:48,721
General Helmuth Weidling, who
commanded the defence of Berlin,

61
00:03:48,741 --> 00:03:51,319
told Hitler that his ammunition
would run out that night.

62
00:03:52,871 --> 00:03:53,846
By one o'clock,

63
00:03:53,866 --> 00:03:56,759
Weidling had permission to
attempt a breakout that night.

64
00:03:58,091 --> 00:04:01,270
Hitler ate lunch with two
secretaries and his cook,

65
00:04:01,642 --> 00:04:04,119
and then said goodbye to
some of those who remained.

66
00:04:05,571 --> 00:04:07,686
At about half past
three in the afternoon,

67
00:04:08,097 --> 00:04:09,771
according to people
who were in the bunker,

68
00:04:10,001 --> 00:04:13,279
he shot himself, and Eva
Braun died by poison.

69
00:04:14,791 --> 00:04:15,664
No one saw it.

70
00:04:16,136 --> 00:04:18,032
Witnesses went into
the room afterwards,

71
00:04:18,223 --> 00:04:20,078
and their accounts differ on details.

72
00:04:21,711 --> 00:04:22,605
As he had ordered,

73
00:04:22,676 --> 00:04:25,538
the bodies were carried to the
garden and burned with petrol.

74
00:04:27,052 --> 00:04:29,037
Soviet shells were still falling.

75
00:04:30,572 --> 00:04:33,538
In the evening, what remained
was buried in a shell crater.

76
00:04:37,991 --> 00:04:41,859
Late on 1 May, Hamburg Radio
announced that Hitler was dead.

77
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:45,910
We have just heard the news here over
our monitoring service

78
00:04:45,940 --> 00:04:47,560
that Adolf Hitler is dead.

79
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:49,860
The announcement came in an official
communique

80
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:51,260
read over Radio Hamburg,

81
00:04:52,692 --> 00:04:56,239
Another reporter, with the Americans
on the Elbe, described the scene.

82
00:04:57,460 --> 00:05:00,260
As reports and rumors flew that Hitler
was dead

83
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:02,660
and that the war was over,

84
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:04,410
as history was swiftly written

85
00:05:04,460 --> 00:05:05,460
across the face of Europe,

86
00:05:06,651 --> 00:05:09,952
The announcement said he
had fallen fighting at his post.

87
00:05:10,564 --> 00:05:12,159
It did not say suicide.

88
00:05:13,611 --> 00:05:16,451
That same day, Goebbels
and his wife died,

89
00:05:16,602 --> 00:05:18,739
after their six children
had been poisoned.

90
00:05:20,251 --> 00:05:23,912
On 2 May, President Truman told
reporters that Hitler was dead,

91
00:05:24,284 --> 00:05:25,919
on the best authority available.

92
00:05:27,471 --> 00:05:31,140
That same day, Soviet troops
took the Reich Chancellery.

93
00:05:32,371 --> 00:05:33,998
Stalin had ordered SMERSH,

94
00:05:34,018 --> 00:05:36,559
the Red Army's counterintelligence,
to find the body.

95
00:05:37,991 --> 00:05:41,041
Germany signed its
surrender at Reims on 7 May,

96
00:05:41,061 --> 00:05:43,599
and again in Berlin on 8 May.

97
00:05:44,952 --> 00:05:47,618
President Truman announced
it to the American people.

98
00:05:48,780 --> 00:05:50,730
General Eisenhower informs me

99
00:05:50,830 --> 00:05:54,180
that the forces of Germany have
surrendered

100
00:05:54,230 --> 00:05:56,080
to the United Nations.

101
00:05:57,351 --> 00:05:59,647
Soviet troops dug up dental remains,

102
00:06:00,078 --> 00:06:04,199
and by 11 May two dental workers
had identified them as Hitler's.

103
00:06:05,791 --> 00:06:09,502
Doenitz's government lasted until
British troops arrested its members

104
00:06:09,522 --> 00:06:11,719
at Flensburg on 23 May.

105
00:06:13,271 --> 00:06:15,547
But Moscow told the
world different things.

106
00:06:16,099 --> 00:06:19,499
In June, Soviet officials gave
two conflicting accounts.

107
00:06:21,151 --> 00:06:24,899
In 1949, a secret dossier
based on interrogations

108
00:06:24,919 --> 00:06:27,213
of bunker survivors
was given to Stalin.

109
00:06:27,645 --> 00:06:29,979
It was not published until 2005.

110
00:06:31,450 --> 00:06:33,363
In November 1945,

111
00:06:33,854 --> 00:06:38,231
British intelligence sent the historian
Hugh Trevor-Roper to investigate.

112
00:06:38,722 --> 00:06:40,675
His book, The Last Days of Hitler,

113
00:06:41,126 --> 00:06:43,219
concluded that Hitler
had killed himself.

114
00:06:44,971 --> 00:06:49,771
In 1946, Soviet investigators
found part of a skull in the crater.

115
00:06:50,442 --> 00:06:53,880
Tests in 2009 suggested that
it belonged to a woman.

116
00:06:55,271 --> 00:06:59,969
In 2017, French experts examined
jaw fragments held in Moscow,

117
00:07:00,501 --> 00:07:05,259
and found that the teeth matched
dental X-rays of Hitler taken in 1944.

118
00:07:06,671 --> 00:07:10,612
In 1956, a West German court
heard forty two witnesses,

119
00:07:10,903 --> 00:07:12,919
and declared Hitler legally dead.

120
00:07:14,551 --> 00:07:18,379
Rumours put him in Spain, in
Argentina, even on a submarine.

121
00:07:19,891 --> 00:07:21,267
On the night of the announcement,

122
00:07:21,499 --> 00:07:23,699
one reporter had already
warned about a myth.

123
00:07:24,860 --> 00:07:29,260
It might all be part of that myth and
mysticism

124
00:07:29,460 --> 00:07:31,760
he and his [...] tried so hard

125
00:07:31,780 --> 00:07:33,460
to build up around themselves.

126
00:07:34,771 --> 00:07:39,194
The FBI and the CIA investigated
reports that he had survived,

127
00:07:39,425 --> 00:07:40,619
and found none credible.

128
00:07:42,171 --> 00:07:46,919
Historians accept that Hitler
killed himself on 30 April 1945.

129
00:07:48,272 --> 00:07:50,737
That night, an American
reporter put it this way.

130
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:54,220
Whether by natural causes,

131
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:57,020
his own hand, or a bullet from the
Nazis themselves,

132
00:07:57,420 --> 00:07:59,220
It will probably be some time before

133
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,620
we ever find out the truth.

134
00:08:02,971 --> 00:08:05,608
Historians agree that he
died by his own hand,

135
00:08:06,060 --> 00:08:09,019
but the only physical proof
that survives is dental.

136
00:08:10,452 --> 00:08:14,179
If the evidence was this thin, why
did Moscow let the world doubt it?
